{
 "name": "net_prologue_tutorial_dusks",
 "description": "VUH-2867, PC1 loopback from FM-01 with a host warp to the Station of Serenity weapon tutorial (02/20 btl154, site tt32-154, three Dusks). No protect: both seats fight; each must deal damage and take a native Dusk hit, all three deaths apply on both, and the friend follows one mission end. Rehearsal warp, not opening-route evidence. No save.",
